$DATUM Synthesis of (POCOP)Rh(p-C6H4Me)(SnC5H11) (15a) and
(POCOP)Rh(Sp-C6H4Me(nC5H11) (15b). 1 (65 mg, 0.135 mmol) was dissolved in
toluene and treated with NaOtBu (14 mg, 0.15 mmol) and p-BrC6H4Me (18 μL,
0.14 mmol) . The reaction was stirred for 15 m at RT. The reaction
mixture was then treated with NaOtBu (14 mg, 0.15 mmol) and HSnC5H11 (18
μL, 0.14 mmol). The reaction was stirred for 5 m at RT before being
filtered through a pad of silica and Celite and the volatiles were
removed under vacuum. The resulting purple solid was dissolved in C6D6.
Analysis by 31P{1H} NMR showed the formation of two products
(POCOP)Rh(p-C6H4Me)(SnC5H11) (15a) (176.0 ppm, d, 123 Hz, 88%) and
(POCOP)Rh(Sp-C6H4Me(nC5H11) (15b) (189.5, d, 173 Hz, 12%). 31P{1H} NMR
(C6D6): δ 176.0 (d, 173 Hz); 1H NMR (C6D6): δ 7.69 (d, 8 Hz, 2H, C6H4Me),
7.00 (t, 8 Hz, 1H, POCOP), 6.91 (d, 7.5 Hz, 2H, POCOP), 6.84 (d, 8 Hz,
2H, C6H4Me), 2.89 (t, 7 Hz, 2H, Pent), 1.97 (s, 3H, C6H4Me), 1.95 (m, 4H,
CHMe2), 1.48 (m, 2H, Pent), 1.29 (q, 6.5 Hz, 12H, CHMe2), 1.20 (q, 8 Hz,
12H, CHMe2), 1.18 (m, 4H, Pent), 0.78 (t, 7 Hz, 3H, Pent). 13C{1H} NMR
(C6D6): δ 167.5 (t, J PC = 9.5 Hz, POCOP), 141.7 (dt, J RhC = 33.8 Hz, J
CP = 10 Hz, POCOP), 138.7 (s), 135.5 (s), 133.6 (s), 129.5 (s), 124.6
(s), 104.1 (t, J CP = 6.8 Hz, POCOP), 48.7 (t, J CP = 5.7 Hz, Pent), 30.9
(s, Pent), 30.7 (t, J CP = 10 Hz, POCOP), 29.3 (s, Pent), 22.7 (s, Pent),
18.7 (t, J CP = 4.4 Hz, POCOP), 17.6 (POCOP), 14.1 (s, Pent).
