$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Synthesis of [2]Rotaxane 8 by Cu-catalyzed Reaction. A mixture of
1,1,1-tris(biphenyl)-7-(4-iodophenoxy)heptane 5 (155 mg, 0.2 mmol),
Cu(I)-phenanthroline complex 2 (17 mg, 0.02 mmol), KOt-Bu (34 mg, 0.3
mmol) and 7,7,7-tris(biphenyl)-1-heptanethiol 6 (130 mg, 0.22 mmol) in
dry toluene (0.6 mL) was stirred at 110 ºC for 48 h. The mixture was
cooled to room temperature, and CH3CN (3 mL), CH2Cl2 (3 mL), KCN (10 mg,
0.15 mmol) and H2O (2 mL) were added. The resulting mixture was stirred
at room temperature for 14 h. The organic layer was separated, and the
aqueous layer was extracted with CH2Cl2. The combined organic layer was
washed with water, dried over Na2SO4 and concentrated in vacuo. The
residue was purified by silica gel column chromatography using
hexane-CH2Cl2 (2/1 (v/v)) as the eluent. [2]Rotaxane (8). Colorless
amorphous (11 mg, 27%). Axle (9). Colorless amorphous (200 mg, 81%),
[2]Rotaxane (8). Colorless amorphous, 1H NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3) δ 8.36 (d,
J = 8.7 Hz, 4H), 8.16 (d, J = 8.4 Hz, 2H), 7.97 (d, J = 8.4 Hz, 2H), 7.68
(s, 2H), 7.54-7.24 (m, 56H), 7.08 (t, J = 8.4 Hz, 1H), 6.92 (d, J = 8.7
Hz, 4H), 6.84 (d, J = 8.4 Hz, 2H), 6.49 (s, 1H), 6.43 (d, J = 8.4 Hz,
2H), 3.85-3.74 (m, 10H), 2.74 (t, J = 7.5 Hz, 2H), 2.61-2.41 (m, 4H),
1.83-1.35 (m, 18H), 1.35-1.00 (m, 14H); 13C NMR (150 MHz, CDCl3) δ 160.3,
158.2, 156.2, 146.5, 146.0, 140.6, 140.6, 138.4, 138.3, 136.7, 132.9,
131.9, 129.8, 129.6, 129.5, 128.9, 128.6, 127.4, 127.1, 127.0, 126.9,
126.7, 126.4, 126.4, 125.6, 119.2, 115.3, 114.7, 106.7, 101.3, 68.0,
67.9, 67.6, 55.9, 55.9, 40.3, 40.3, 35.8, 30.3, 30.1, 29.7, 29.6, 29.4,
29.1, 28.9, 26.0, 26.0, 25.8; IR (KBr) 2933, 1601, 1587, 1487, 1249,
1173, 1007, 835, 764, 744, 696 cm-1;HR FAB-MS (M + H) Calcd for C13
4H125N2O5 1873.9314. Found 1873.9309. Axle (9). Colorless amorphous, 1H
NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3) 7.59 (d, J = 8.7 Hz, 12H), 7.52 (d, J = 8.7 Hz,
12H), 7.43-7.24 (m, 32H), 6.74 (d, J = 9.0 Hz, 2H), 3.83 (t, J = 6.5 Hz,
2H), 2.75 (t, J = 7.1 Hz, 2H), 2.70-2.55 (m, 4H), 1.76-1.61 (m, 2H),
1.58-1.45 (m, 2H), 1.45-1.28 (m, 8H), 1.27-1.07 (m, 4H); 13C NMR (150
MHz, CDCl3) δ 158.2, 146.5, 140.6, 140.6, 138.5, 138.5, 132.8, 129.6,
128.7, 127.1, 126.9, 126.5, 126.4, 115.0, 67.9, 56.0, 56.0, 40.3, 40.3,
35.7, 30.1, 29.9, 29.3, 29.2, 28.5, 25.9, 25.6, 25.5; IR (KBr) 2933,
1601, 1587, 1249, 1173, 1007, 835, 764, 744, 696 cm-1; Anal. Calcd for
C92H82OS: C, 89.42; H, 6.69. Found: C, 89.43; H, 6.77.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Synthesis of [2]Rotaxanes by the Catalytic Reactions of a Macrocyclic
Copper Complex
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Saito, Shinichi; Takahashi, Eiko; Nakazono, Kazuko
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Organic Letters (2006), 8(22), 5133-5136

